OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after fatal classic
OL,4,Acar crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing death by careless driving while
OL,8,Funder the influence of drugs following
OL,9,Fa crash in which the driver of a
OL,10,Fclassic car was killed.
OL,12,FThe collision took place at about 20:20
OL,13,FBST on Saturday and involved a green
OL,14,FAustin A35 and a black Mazda 6 Sport on
OL,15,Fthe A34 southbound near Sutton Scotney,
OL,16,FHampshire.
OL,18,FA 63-year-old man from Romsey was
OL,19,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
