OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after fatal classic
OL,4,Acar crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire Police said the driver of the
OL,7,FMazda, a 21-year-old man from Tidworth,
OL,8,FWiltshire, was arrested at the scene on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of causing death by driving
OL,10,Fwithout due care or consideration while
OL,11,Funfit through drugs.
